png", "id": "773918394382701", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003236_773918397716034_2302815709020033590_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DVTasKswkawQ7kNvwH9Lt2D&_nc_oc=AdoqlY7xK5JTVasr0g67-J6EbQt66XyVwf-kG57r5_674f4bcccAT8rv_QK7pWvmf8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97zme2AFEh5Yzv5EQcfA8g8WeUF6FJWzsqFxevI11PDg&oe=6A43B5CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BoxelXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "BoxelXR is a simple voxel editor designed specifically for virtual reality (VR) platforms. With its intuitive interface and easy-to-use tools, BoxelXR allows users to create stunning 3D voxel models easily.\n\nVoxel-based modeling is an approach to 3D design, which allows users to work with blocks or \"voxels\" rather than traditional polygons. This approach is particularly well-suited to VR, as it allows for a more immersive and intuitive design experience.\n\nBoxelXR makes voxel modelling accessible to everyone, whether you're an experienced 3D artist or a beginner. Its simple, intuitive interface lets you start quickly, with no complex menus or confusing navigation options.\n\nBoxelXR is an impressive tool for anyone interested in VR-based 3D modeling. Its intuitive interface, powerful tools make it a must-have app for anyone serious about virtual reality design.\n\nOnce you have created a model in BoxelXR, then you can export it as an OBJ file to your favourite 3D editor.", "short_description": "BoxelXR is a simple voxel editor designed specifically for virtual reality (VR) platforms. With its intuitive interface and easy-to-use tools, BoxelXR allows users to create stunning 3D voxel models easily.\n\nBoxelXR makes voxel modelling accessible to everyone, whether you're an experienced 3D artist or a beginner.\n\nOnce you have created a model in BoxelXR, then you can export it as an OBJ file to your favourite 3D editor."}]}, "developer_name":